# Smart Logics

> Smart Logics builds AI agents, generative AI, computer vision, machine learning and custom software for operating businesses, and provides dedicated engineering capacity.

## Industries
- [Retail & E-commerce](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/retail-ecommerce/): Smarter customer experiences and efficient operations, from shelf analytics to personalised service.
- [SaaS & Technology](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/saas-technology/): AI features that ship inside your product: assistants, search, automation and analytics.
- [Finance](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/finance/): Intelligent workflows and secure data solutions for finance and insurance teams that handle sensitive information.
- [Healthcare](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/healthcare/): AI-powered tools that reduce administrative load and support better patient care.
- [Manufacturing](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/manufacturing/): Vision systems and automation for higher productivity, quality inspection, safer floors and energy operations.
- [Education](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/education/): Modern learning platforms and intelligent content tools for institutions and training providers.
- [Sports & Recreation](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/sports-recreation/): Automated capture, analytics and highlights for courts, clubs and facilities.
- [Insurance](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/insurance/): Faster claims and underwriting by reading documents, flagging risk and automating routine steps.
- [Renewable Energy](https://thesmartlogics.com/industries/renewable-energy/): Analytics and automation for solar, wind and other renewable operations.

